==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Flashfire|Luxray|34}} from the {{TCG|Flashfire}} expansion.
*'''Volt Bolt''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Dark Explorers|Raikou-EX|38}} from the {{TCG|Dark Explorers}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

